OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAreas of
OL,6,Fcloud and some clearer periods. Most
OL,7,Fparts dry but thicker cloud developing
OL,8,Facross the Peak District later with
OL,9,Fsome patchy light rain, drizzle and
OL,10,Fhill fog. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAreas of cloud giving a few
OL,13,Flight showers in places through the
OL,14,Fmorning but generally drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter into the afternoon. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarm . Breezy later ahead of overnight
OL,17,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
